"Durable conclusions from the consolidation — each kept with its evidence and its birthday. Forget one and the mind remembers the forgetting: it will not quietly re-teach it tomorrow." = "Duurhafti Schlüss us de Konsolidierig — jede mit sim Bewiis ond sim Geburtstag bhalte. Vergiss eini, ond de Verstand erinneret sich as Vergässe: er wird sie morn ned still nomol lehre.";
