"Learned only while EMCON is up on the home subnet — three banked nights hold the pattern, and after that the tab stops reporting events and starts reporting deviations. It learns from the tripwire's hearing alone; a quiet house teaches it a quiet pattern." = "Wird nur glehrt, solang EMCON uf em Hei-Subnetz obe esch — drü gspeichereti Nächt halte s Muschter, und danach hört de Tab uf, Ereignis z melde, und föht aa, Abwiichige z melde. Es lehrt nur us em Ghör vom Stolperdraht; es ruhigs Huus lehrt em es ruhigs Muschter.";
"Leave a drop: seal a short message and arm this phone's GATT host with it. Anyone in Bluetooth range can read the sealed bytes; only the pairing key opens them. A paired phone that comes hunting files it in a thread named brush — and you never learn it was taken. EMCON stands the GATT host down, so a drop does not survive going dark." = "En Drop hinerloh: Versiegle e churzi Nachricht und rüschte das Handy si GATT-Host demit us. Jede i Bluetooth-Riichwiiti cha die versiegelte Byte läse; nur de Pairing-Schlüssel öffnet sie. Es pairts Handy, wo jage chunnt, leit sie in en Thread namens brush ab — und du erfahrsch nie, dass sie gno worde esch. EMCON stellt de GATT-Host ab, drum überläbt en Drop s Dunkelwärde ned.";
"Leave a payload living on the target: a service that stores things keeps yours until someone comes to collect. Verify with SnatchSteal or the Redis GET check." = "Loh e Payload uf em Ziil läbe: En Service, wo Sache speicheret, bhaltet dini, bis öpper sie hole chunnt. Prüef's mit SnatchSteal oder em Redis-GET-Check.";
