"Night wire. The honest hours." = "Nachtdraht. Die ehrleche Stunde.";
"Night. The wire and I have it." = "Nacht. De Draht und ech händ's.";
"No Wi-Fi address on this phone" = "Keini Wi-Fi-Adrässe uf dem Handy";
"No address swept for this device yet — run a sweep on the Scan tab and its dossier gains a knock." = "Für das Grät esch no kei Adrässe gsweept — mach en Sweep uf em Scan-Tab und sis Dossier überchunnt en Aachlopf.";
"No backdrop in this build. The app looks for wallpaper.gif in the bundle (or a \"Wallpaper\" data asset) — and wears plain black until it finds one." = "Keis Hintergrundbild i dere Version. D App suecht nach wallpaper.gif im Bundle (oder emene «Wallpaper»-Daten-Asset) — ond treit eifach schwarz, bes sie eis fendet.";
"No captured bytes yet. When the tripwire catches a knock, its first words are kept — and become ammunition here: replayed, mutated, and fired at your own Serve to see what holds." = "No kei gfange Bytes. Wen de Stolperdraht es Chlopfe fängt, werden sini erschte Wort bhalte — ond si werden do zur Munition: abgspilt, verändert ond gäg dis eigene Serve gschosse, zum luege, was hebt.";
"No coin yet. Claim any NFC tag, or mint a blank one with the mark of the house." = "No kei Münz. Übernimm en beliebige NFC-Tag, oder präg en leere met em Zeiche vom Huus.";
"No conversations yet. Open one by address — the other phone needs the app, the same pairing key, and EMCON up." = "No kei Gspräch. Fang eis aa über d Adrässe — s andere Handy bruucht d App, de gliich Koppligsschlüssel ond EMCON obe.";
"No decoded details — the broadcast carried nothing the decoders read." = "Kei entschlüssleti Details — d Ussändig het nüt treit, wo d Decoder läsed.";
"No drift — it answers exactly as baselined." = "Kei Drift — es antwortet genau wie i de Basislinie.";
"No findings. Either the house is at peace, or the mind is still learning what peace looks like here." = "Kei Befund. Entweder esch s Huus i Rueh, oder de Verstand lehrt no, wie Rueh do usgseht.";
"No home subnet is marked, so there is no turf to learn." = "Keis Hei-Subnetz esch markiert, also geds keis Revier zum lehre.";
"No key yet: Knocktalk seals with ChaCha20-Poly1305, and without the shared key nothing here can be sealed or opened." = "No kei Schlüssel: Knocktalk versieglet met ChaCha20-Poly1305, ond ohni de teilt Schlüssel cha do nüt versieglet oder ufgmacht werde.";
"No lessons yet — the canary learns from whoever talks to it." = "No kei Lektione — de Kanarievogu lehrt vo jedem, wo met em redt.";
"No macros yet. Build one block by block below, start from a template, or tell Skelli the steps — she builds them too." = "No kei Makros. Bau eis Block för Block unde, fang met ere Vorlag aa, oder säg Skelli d Schritt — sie bout si ou.";
"No nearby phones right now — start serving on another phone on this Wi-Fi and it appears here, or type an address." = "Grad kei Handys i de Nöchi — start s Dienschte uf emene andere Handy i dem Wi-Fi, ond es erschynt do, oder tipp en Adrässe ii.";
"No neighbors yet. Run a sweep, let Bonjour resolve, or simply be knocked — the wire will populate its own cast." = "No kei Nachbare. Mach en Sweep, la Bonjour uflöse, oder la der eifach aachlopfe — de Draht füllt sini eigeni Bsetzig.";
"No probers yet. When something knocks, its file opens here." = "No kei Prüefer. Wen öppis aachlopft, geit sini Akte do uf.";
"No rendezvous yet" = "No keis Rendezvous";
"No sessions yet. Start one on the Listen tab; each session becomes a .jsonl file you can share to the Mac and feed to `nightjar report` and `nightjar trackers`." = "No kei Sitzige. Start eini uf em Tab Lose; jedi Sitzig wird zu enere .jsonl-Datei, wo de uf de Mac teile ond `nightjar report` ond `nightjar trackers` füetere chasch.";
"No." = "Nei.";
"No. Doesn't parse — and I'm not in the mood to guess. Shorter." = "Nei. Das längt sech ned analysiere — ond ech ha kei Luscht zum Rate. Chürzer.";
"Nobody has knocked. When someone runs these probes against this phone, it lands here — source, port, and which first words they used. The log persists across launches. The tripwire never replies." = "Niemer het aagchlopft. Wen öpper die Prüefige gäg das Handy fahrt, landet s do — Quell, Port ond welchi erschte Wort er bruucht het. S Protokoll blibt über d Starts ewäg bschtaa. De Stolperdraht antwortet nie.";
"None" = "Keis";
"None — black" = "Keis — schwarz";
"Not heard advertising under this name. (Listen matches by name only — a name is a claim, not an identity.)" = "Under dem Name ned ghört wärbe. (Lose glycht nur über de Name ab — en Name esch en Aaschpruch, kei Identität.)";
"Not heard in this session yet. It may be asleep, out of range — or, if it rotates its address, gone under a new one." = "I dere Sitzig no ned ghört. Es schlaft viellicht, esch usser Riichwiiti — oder, wen s sini Adrässe rotiert, under enere neue verschwunde.";
"Not in earshot this session — the placement is kept for its return." = "Die Sitzig ned i Hörwiiti — d Platzierig wird för sini Rückkehr bhalte.";
"Not now" = "Ned jetz";
"Not on Wi-Fi — join a network and the recon tools wake up." = "Ned im Wi-Fi — gang is es Netzwerk, ond d Ufklärigswärchzüg erwached.";
"Not ready" = "Ned parat";
"Not serving — the ring is down" = "Dienscht ned — de Ring esch unde";
"Not so" = "Ned eso";
"Not yet" = "No ned";
"Note — what this playlist is for" = "Notiz — woför die Playlist esch";
"Noted." = "Notiert.";
"Noted. Thrilling." = "Notiert. Ufregend.";
"Nothing answered on any probed port, on loopback or the LAN address. From out there, this device is a rumor." = "Nüt het uf emene prüefte Port gantwortet, weder uf Loopback no uf de LAN-Adrässe. Vo dusse esch das Grät es Gred.";
"Nothing answered on those ports." = "Nüt het uf dene Ports gantwortet.";
"Nothing filed yet. What she forges and builds lands here." = "No nüt abgleit. Was sie schmiedet ond bout, landet do.";
"Nothing fresh in the air. The ear wakes in Listen." = "Nüt Früschs i de Luft. S Ohr erwacht i Lose.";
"Nothing heard yet in this epoch. Start Listen, run a trace or a War Room operation — the registry fills from what the organs hear." = "I dere Epoche no nüt ghört. Start Lose, fahr e Spur oder en Operation im Chriegsruum — s Regischter füllt sech us dem, wo d Organ ghöred.";
"Nothing in the log answers that — and it would rather say so than invent." = "Nüt im Protokoll antwortet uf das — ond es säit das lieber, als öppis z erfende.";
"Nothing is running, and nothing has finished lately — the house is quiet." = "Nüt louft, ond nüt esch letschti fertig worde — s Huus esch ruehig.";
"Nothing journaled yet. Serve arrivals, tripwire knocks, EMCON posture changes, sparring runs and listening-session bounds land here as one timeline — the whole instrument, one night at a time." = "No nüt im Tagebuech. Serve-Aakünft, Stolperdraht-Chlopf, EMCON-Haltigsänderige, Sparringsläuf ond Gränze vo de Lossitzige landed do als eini Ziitlinie — s ganze Inschtrument, Nacht för Nacht.";
"Nothing off-pattern tonight." = "Hüt Nacht nüt us em Muster.";
"Nothing open." = "Nüt offe.";
"Nothing received yet." = "No nüt empfange.";
"Nothing sealed or structured has knocked. A scan sweeps; anything that spells — and fails to open — lands here." = "Nüt Versiegelts oder Strukturierts het aagchlopft. En Scan fägt; alles, wo buchstabiert — ond sech ned ufmache laht — landet do.";
"Nothing survived the drill. The second scan found a clean device." = "Nüt het d Üebig überlebt. De zwöit Scan het es subers Grät gfunde.";
"Nothing went quiet." = "Nüt esch still worde.";
"Nothing yet — sends, replies, and listener events land here." = "No nüt — Sändige, Antworte ond Hörereräignis landed do.";
"Nothing yet. As the record deepens, the mind writes down what it concludes — quiet hours, a regular's rhythm, two who stir together — and keeps it here." = "No nüt. Wenn d Ufzeichnig tüüfer wird, schribt de Verstand uf, was er schlüsst — ruehigi Stunde, de Rhythmus vomene Stammgascht, zwee, wo sech zäme rüehred — ond bhaltet s do.";
"Nothing yet. The first message knocks the whole conversation open — fragments, about twelve seconds each, and the other phone knocks its ACK back the same way." = "No nüt. Die erscht Nachricht chlopft s ganze Gspräch uf — Fragment, öppe zwölf Sekunde jedes, ond s andere Handy chlopft sis ACK uf di gliich Art zrugg.";
"Now" = "Jetz";
"Now running" = "Louft jetz";
"OK" = "OK";
"OPTIONS" = "OPTIONS";
"OVERDUE — the hand falls at the next opening." = "ÜBERFÄLLIG — d Hand fallt bi de nächschte Öffnig.";
"Observation feed" = "Beobachtigsfeed";
"Observe" = "Beobachte";
"Off home turf — this network is not your marked home. Going dark is advised." = "Ab vom Heirevier — das Netzwerk esch ned dis markiert Dehei. Dunkel werde esch empfohle.";
"Off stills every GIF in the house: the boot film and the splashes stand on their first frame, and the wallpaper reel holds still. Nothing is removed — the pictures stay, the motion goes." = "Us stellt jedes GIF im Huus still: de Bootfilm ond d Spritzer blibed uf ihrem erschte Bild staa, ond d Tapeterolle hebt still. Nüt wird entfernt — d Bilder blibed, d Bewegig geit.";
"Offer the duel" = "Biet s Duell aa";
"Oh good. Company." = "Oh guet. Gsellschaft.";
"Old enough to know better. Young enough to knock anyway." = "Alt gnueg, zum s besser z wüsse. Jung gnueg, zum gliich aazchlopfe.";
"On the air. Holders of this key, listening now, can see it." = "Uf Sendig. Wär de Schlüssel het ond jetz lost, cha s gseh.";
"On the board" = "Uf em Brätt";
"On the wire" = "Uf em Draht";
"On this Wi-Fi · Bonjour" = "I dem Wi-Fi · Bonjour";
"One 256-bit key, both phones, kept in the Keychain. Generate it on one phone and carry it to the other — or paste the one it made." = "Ei 256-Bit-Schlüssel, beidi Handys, im Keychain bhalte. Generier ne uf eim Handy ond trag ne zum andere — oder füeg de ii, wo s gmacht het.";
"One JSON: this timeline, the knock record, and the trace's own export embedded whole." = "Ei JSON: die Ziitlinie, s Chlopfprotokoll ond de eigen Export vo de Spur, ganz iigbettet.";
"One choice, now — the whole house speaks it, Skelli included. Change it any time in About." = "Eini Wahl, jetz — s ganze Huus redt si, Skelli iigschlosse. Ändere si jederziit im About.";
"One drill tests a wall; a season tests the watch. The ghost visits while the instrument is awake — a closed app has no ears, and the season does not pretend otherwise." = "E Üebig prüeft e Wand; e Saison prüeft d Wacht. De Geischt chunnt, wen s Inschtrument wach esch — en zuegni App het kei Ohre, ond d Saison tuet ned eso, als wär s andersch.";
"One of these names is a lie. I intend to find which." = "Eine vo dene Näme esch e Lüüg. Ech will usefende, wele.";
"One operation: Listen (if the air is included) and the trace run as one, then the knock bench works every door the trace confirmed — all of it on one timeline, all of it in one export." = "Ei Operation: Lose (wen d Luft drbi esch) ond d Spur loufed als eis, denn bearbeitet d Chlopfbänk jedi Tür, wo d Spur bestätigt het — alles uf einere Ziitlinie, alles i eim Export.";
"One page per device, every organ's testimony: what Scan heard, whether Listen has heard the name over Bluetooth, and a Recon knock on demand." = "Ei Siite pro Grät, d Ussag vo jedem Organ: was Scan ghört het, ob Lose de Name über Bluetooth ghört het, ond en Recon-Chlopf uf Wunsch.";
"One payload, a whole list of targets — typed, pasted, imported from a file, or harvested from the network by the Scan tab." = "Ei Nutzlascht, e ganzi Liste vo Zil — tippt, iigfüegt, us enere Datei importiert oder vom Scan-Tab us em Netzwerk gärntet.";
"One phone defends (Serve up, decoys flying), the other attacks (trace and knock). The match protocol rides the Serve inbox, and the scoring diffs what was found against what was run and caught." = "Eis Handy verteidigt (Serve obe, Köder flüüged), s andere griff aa (Spur ond Chlopf). S Matchprotokoll riitet uf em Serve-Poschteigang, ond d Wertig verglycht, was gfunde worde esch, met dem, wo gfahre ond gfange worde esch.";
"One phone is the ground, the other the blade: three rounds of strikes against its real surface, refereed by its own event log." = "Eis Handy esch de Bode, s andere d Klinge: drüü Runde Schleg gäg sini würklich Oberflächi, grichtet vo sim eigene Eräignisprotokoll.";
"One tap: full knock and Bonjour audit, then EMCON engages, then both run again and the difference is read out here." = "Ei Tipp: volle Chlopf ond Bonjour-Audit, denn griff EMCON ii, denn loufed beidi nomol, ond de Underschied wird do vorgläse.";
