"Pass after pass it will sweep this wire, let it announce itself, and knock the full census against every known device — for as long as you leave it armed. Anything watching for exactly this will see the phone coming, and on networks you do not own that attention may arrive with questions attached." = "Durchgang för Durchgang wird s de Draht fäge, sech selber aakündige ond de voll Zensus gäg jedes bekannte Grät chlopfe — so lang, wie de s scharf lasch. Alles, wo genau uf das wartet, wird s Handy gseh cho, ond uf Netzwerke, wo ned der ghöred, cha die Ufmerksamkeit met Frage dra cho.";
"Password" = "Passwort";
"Patch two doors together and let them talk: door A is knocked (its port's probe when smart seed is on), its reply is carried verbatim to B, B's reply back to A — until silence, an echo, a repeat, or the rounds run out. Any targets the route parser accepts; a train or range speaks through its first door." = "Verbind zwee Türe ond la si rede: Tür A wird aagchlopft (d Prüefig vo ihrem Port, wen Smart Seed aa esch), ihri Antwort wird wortwörtlich zu B treit, Bs Antwort zrugg zu A — bes Stilli, es Echo, e Widerholig oder d Runde usgönd. Alli Zil, wo de Route-Parser akzeptiert; en Zug oder Bereich redt dür sini erscht Tür.";
