"Reflexes you arm once, fired without you: a trigger on the wire, an action the instrument already knows. Each rule rests five minutes between firings, every firing is journaled, and actions needing a mouth or a target degrade to the journal line alone when they have neither. Firing the bench stays your press — a reflex can load Recon, never pull its trigger." = "Reflex, wo de eimal scharf machsch, abgfüüret ohni dech: en Uslöser uf em Draht, en Aktion, wo s Inschtrument scho kennt. Jedi Regle rueht füf Minute zwüsche de Uslösige, jedi Uslösig wird is Tagebuech treit, ond Aktione, wo es Muul oder es Zil bruuched, falled uf d Tagebuechziile elei zrugg, wen si keis vo beide händ. S Abfüüre vo de Bänk blibt di Druck — en Reflex cha Recon lade, nie sin Abzug zieh.";
"Refuse" = "Ablehne";
