"Two keys are kept for the house, both in the Keychain, neither ever shown: the Vault's AES-256 key, and the P-256 identity whose public half (above) others seal dead-drops to. Private keys do not leave the Keychain — that is the whole arrangement." = "Zwei Schlüssel wärde für s Huus bhalte, beidi im Keychain, keine je zeigt: de AES-256-Schlüssel vom Vault und di P-256-Identität, wo iri öffentlechi Hälfti (obe) anderi Dead-Drops druf versigle. Privati Schlüssel verloo de Keychain nie — das esch di ganzi Abmachig.";
"Two of your own phones, both foreground. Control rides the Serve inbox — both phones serve during a match." = "Zwei vo dine eigene Handys, beidi im Vordergrund. D Steuerig riitet uf de Serve-Inbox — beidi Handys diene während eme Match.";
