"What a tag tells any reader, read whole: its kind, its identifier, its NDEF records, and an APDU explorer for ISO 7816 cards. Nothing is written, emulated, or cloned." = "Was en Tag jedem Läser verrootet, ganz gläse: sini Art, sini Kennig, sini NDEF-Iiträg und en APDU-Explorer für ISO-7816-Charte. Nüt wird gschribe, emuliert oder klont.";
"What changed about this device, in the house's own words." = "Was sech a dem Grät gänderet het, i de eigene Wort vom Huus.";
"What plays when the app opens: the film, the print, and the manifest of true facts about this device. Off stops the ceremony entirely — the app opens straight onto its tabs, and none of it runs." = "Was lauft, wenn d App uufgoot: de Film, de Druck und s Manifest vo wohre Fakte über das Grät. Uus stoppt d Zeremonie ganz — d App goot direkt uf iri Tabs uuf, und nüt devo lauft.";
