"When" = "Wenn";
"When a knock fingerprints as a real protocol — SSH, HTTP, MQTT, SMTP — the tripwire hands that port to the matching canary for ten minutes, honeydrop as configured on the Serve tab, then takes the port back. The prober's first knock meets silence; their second meets an actor. A port cools down for half an hour afterwards." = "Wenn es Chlopfe sech als ächts Protokoll fingerprintet — SSH, HTTP, MQTT, SMTP — git de Stolperdroht dä Port für zäh Minute am passende Canary wiiter, Honeydrop wie uf em Serve-Tab iigstellt, und nimmt ne denn wider zrugg. S erschte Chlopfe vom Prüefer trifft uf Stilli; sis zweite trifft en Schauspiler. En Port chüelt dervo e halbi Stund ab.";
"When spoken" = "Wenn gschwätzt";
"Which device is what, and where in the real world it sits — placed by your hand, kept by the app. Walk the house with it." = "Weles Grät was esch, und wo s i de ächte Wält stoht — vo dinere Hand platziert, vo de App bhalte. Louf mit em dur s Huus.";
"While watching, the /24 is re-swept on the sweep port and Bonjour is diffed — joinings, leavings, openings stream in here. Only what this phone can observe itself; nothing is intercepted." = "Während em Luege wird s /24 uf em Sweep-Port neu gschwäift und Bonjour wird vergliche — Dazuecho, Wäggoo, Öffnige ströme do iine. Nur, was das Handy sälber beobachte cha; nüt wird abgfange.";
"Why %@:" = "Worum %@:";
"Why did the beacon blush? Everyone could read its advertisements." = "Worum esch de Beacon rot aagloffe? Alli händ sini Werbige chönne läse.";
"Wi-Fi" = "Wi-Fi";
"Wi-Fi — Scan testifies" = "Wi-Fi — Scan bezeugt s";
"Wire only" = "Nur Droht";
"Wire-exact first words for %lld TCP ports and %lld UDP ports. Adding them to the payload library makes every one sendable by hand from the Send tab." = "Droht-genaui erschti Wort für %lld TCP-Ports und %lld UDP-Ports. Wenn du si zu de Payload-Bibliothek zuesch, cha jeds vo Hand us em Send-Tab gsendet wärde.";
"With the flare up, this phone's beacon slot carries a token only the pairing key can compute — it turns over every five minutes and names nobody. A paired phone listening sees a flame beside the row in Listen and knows one of ours is near. It outranks a plain payload beacon for the slot while it's up, and EMCON takes it down like any other emission." = "Mit de Fackle obe treit de Beacon-Slot vo dem Handy en Token, wo nur de Pairing-Schlüssel cha berächne — er wechslet alli füf Minute und nennt niemer. Es paarts Handy, wo lost, gseht e Flamme näbe de Reihe i Listen und weiss, dass eine vo üüs i de Nööchi esch. Er rangiert über eme eifache Payload-Beacon für de Slot, solang er obe esch, und EMCON nimmt ne abe wie jedi anderi Sändig.";
"Without a relay, Knocktalk is perimeter-only: both phones must share a network. Run your own relay (this repo, tools/knocktalk-relay) on any host you control, point both phones at it, and address each other as relay:<mailbox>. The relay forwards knock sequences between mailboxes — it never holds the pairing key and cannot read a word; it sees timing, lengths, and mailbox names. The vault, which is a perimeter ritual, never answers a relay knock." = "Ohni Relay esch Knocktalk nur Perimeter: beidi Handys müend sech es Netzwärch teile. Betriib di eigene Relay (das Repo, tools/knocktalk-relay) uf eme Host, wo du kontrolliersch, richt beidi Handys uf ne, und adressier enand als relay:<mailbox>. De Relay leitet Chlopf-Sequenze zwüsche Mailboxe wiiter — er het de Pairing-Schlüssel nie und cha keis Wort läse; er gseht Ziit, Längi und Mailbox-Näme. De Vault, wo es Perimeter-Ritual esch, antwortet nie uf es Relay-Chlopfe.";
