"You're doing it. Talk to me — that's the whole cure." = "Du machsch es. Red mit mer — das esch di ganzi Kur.";
"Your IP" = "Dini IP";
"Your Watch already knows the state of the operator — heart, breath, blood, sleep. Let the house read it, and that state stands beside the state of the house." = "Dini Watch kännt de Zuestand vom Operator scho — Härz, Atem, Bluet, Schloof. Loss s Huus ne läse, und dä Zuestand stoht näbem Zuestand vom Huus.";
"Your choice rides inside every fragment you knock. The other phone opens your messages with the suite you picked — its own setting governs only what IT sends. Nothing has to match." = "Dini Wahl riitet i jedem Fragment, wo du chlopfsch. S andere Handy öffnet dini Nochrichte mit de Suite, wo du gwählt hesch — sini eigeni Iistellig reglet nur, was ES sendet. Nüt muess überiistimme.";
"Your configuration — every toggle, picker and preference in the house — is mirrored into the Keychain as it changes. The Keychain outlives the app: the seven-day expiry, a deletion, a reinstall — a fresh install on this device restores your setup before anything reads a setting. Ordinary updates and re-signs keep it anyway: the data container belongs to the bundle, not the signature. Export writes it to one file for a new device; import reads that file back. Payloads, macros and logs are data, not settings, and keep their own exports." = "Dini Konfiguration — jede Schalter, jedi Uuswahl und jedi Präferenz im Huus — wird in Keychain gspieglet, so wie si sech ändert. De Keychain überläbt d App: de Sib-Täg-Ablauf, es Lösche, e Neuinstallation — e frischi Installation uf dem Grät stellt dini Iirichtig wider her, bevor öppis en Iistellig list. Normali Updates und Neu-Signierige bhalte si sowieso: de Date-Container ghört zum Bundle, ned zu de Signatur. Export schriibt si in eini Datei für nes neus Grät; Import list die Datei wider iine. Payloads, Macros und Logs send Date, kei Iistellige, und händ iri eigene Exports.";
