"Your own" = "Dis eigene";
"Your own art is copied into the app and never leaves this device; a GIF plays, a photograph holds still. Changes take hold from the next launch, and a tap still skips the boot." = "Dini eigeni Kunst wird i d App kopiert und verlot das Grät nie; es GIF spielt, e Fotografie bliibt still. Änderige griffe ab em nöchste Start, und es Tippe überspringt de Boot immer no.";
"Your own costume name" = "Di eigene Kostüm-Name";
"Your own gear, or a network you're engaged to test — the scanner asks politely and reports what answers." = "Dis eigene Grät, oder es Netzwärch, wo du beuuftreit besch z teste — de Scanner frogt höflich und meldet, was antwortet.";
"Your own named configurations — cipher, derivation rounds, output dress — saved beside the presets and kept with the house's setup, mirror and all. A configuration seals and opens with a password in the workbench." = "Dini eigene benannte Konfiguratione — Chiffre, Ableitigsrunde, Uusgab-Chleid — näbe de Presets gspeicheret und mit de Iirichtig vom Huus bhalte, Spiegel und alles. E Konfiguration versiglet und öffnet sech mit eme Passwort i de Wärchbank.";
"Your own personas, built from the same cloth as the rack's: a name, a greeting, Serve's dress, and whether the shape stands listed. Swipe one away to clear it." = "Dini eigene Personas, gmacht us em gliiche Stoff wie die vom Gstell: en Name, e Begrüessig, s Chleid vo Serve, und öb d Form glischtet stoht. Wisch eini wäg, zum si lösche.";
"Your phone stays silent; a paired phone speaks. Lend this phone's mouth and any paired hand can throw small payloads through it — the bytes leave THIS device. Or throw through theirs: the instruction rides Knocktalk, sealed, and the receipt comes back the same road. Payloads are signals — a word, a command, a wake-up." = "Dis Handy bliibt still; es paarts Handy redt. Lieh dem Handy sis Muul und jedi paarti Hand cha chliini Payloads dur s wirfe — d Bytes verloo DAS Grät. Oder wirf dur ires: d Aawiisig riitet uf Knocktalk, versiglet, und d Quittig chunt de gliich Wäg zrugg. Payloads send Signal — es Wort, en Befähl, es Ufwecke.";
