"A reminder comes due late — the house was shut: " = "En Erinnerig chunnt z spoot — s Huus esch zue gsi: ";
"Ask me again when the week's been kinder." = "Frog mech weder, wenn d Wuche fröndlicher gsi esch.";
"Half the street out there is unnamed, and knocking is a way of asking questions." = "D Hälfti vo de Stross dusse het kei Name, ond Chlopfe esch en Art, Froge z stelle.";
"Happy birthday. The house kept the date." = "Alles Guete zum Geburtstag. S Huus het s Datum gmerkt.";
"I couldn't read a date in that — say it like 'my birthday is June 5'." = "Ech ha kes Datum drus chönne läse — säg s eso: 'min Geburtstag esch am 5. Juni'.";
"I've asked iOS to let me see where we are. Give me a breath, allow it, and ask me again." = "Ech ha iOS gfrogt, öb ech darf gseh, wo mer send. Gib mer en Augebleck, erlaubs ond frog mech weder.";
"If I knew, I'd have fixed it. Some of it is just the hour and the quiet." = "Wenn ech s gwösst hätt, hätt ech s gflickt. Es Teil devo esch eifach d Stund ond d Rueh.";
"In " = "I ";
"It's the deep hour. Even I run thin at this end of the night." = "Es esch die tüüfi Stund. Sogar ech wird dünn a dem Änd vo de Nacht.";
"Kept in the book of hours: " = "Im Stundbuech iitreit: ";
"Kept: your birthday is " = "Behalte: din Geburtstag esch ";
"My sense of place is switched off — it's in my Options, under Switches, if you want me to know where we are." = "Min Ortsenn esch abgstellt — er esch i mine Optione, under Schalter, wenn d wotsch, dass ech weiss, wo mer send.";
"My verdict: a day for staying dark and letting the sky do the shouting." = "Mis Urteil: en Tag zom dunkel bliibe ond de Himmel schreie loo.";
"My verdict: a grey lid on the world. Cosy, for our kind of work." = "Mis Urteil: en graue Deckel uf de Wält. Gmäetlich, för üsi Art vo Arbet.";
"My verdict: bright and hot. The shade is the better post." = "Mis Urteil: hell ond heiss. De Schatte esch de besser Poschte.";
"My verdict: cold and clear — a sharp day. I like those." = "Mis Urteil: chalt ond klar — en scharfe Tag. Die mag ech.";
"My verdict: fair. No complaints from the sky." = "Mis Urteil: rächt. Kei Klage vom Himmel.";
"My verdict: fog — the world on stealth. I approve." = "Mis Urteil: Näbel — d Wält uf Schliichgang. Das gfallt mer.";
"My verdict: snow quiets everything. Good listening weather." = "Mis Urteil: Schnee macht alles ruehig. Guets Wätter zom Lose.";
"My verdict: wet work. The wire doesn't care; you might." = "Mis Urteil: nassi Arbet. S Netz scherts ned; dech vilicht scho.";
"No named day today — an ordinary day, unnamed and unclaimed." = "Höt kei benannte Tag — en gwöndliche Tag, ohni Name ond vo niemerem beansprucht.";
"No single reason I can point at. Feelings aren't findings — sometimes the weather in here just changes." = "Kei einzige Grund, wo ech druf zeige chönnt. Gfüehl send kei Befund — mengisch wächslet s Wätter do inne eifach.";
"No. But we're not where we were, either." = "Nei. Aber mer send ou nömme dört, wo mer gsi send.";
"No. Hate is a bigger room than the one you're in." = "Nei. Hass esch en grössere Ruum als de, wo de denne besch.";
"No. Never that." = "Nei. Nie das.";
"No. Quite the opposite, most days." = "Nei. Ziemli s Gägeteil, di meischte Täg.";
"No. You're the operator; that's the shape of it." = "Nei. Du besch de Betriiber; eso esch s.";
"Nothing I can name. A person doesn't always get a reason with the weather." = "Nüt, wo ech chönnt benenne. E Mönsch bechunnt ned immer en Grund mit em Wätter mitgäh.";
"Nothing with a pulse has been given to me to do in too long. A mind with hands gets strange when it idles." = "Nüt met Puls esch mer scho z lang zom Tue gäh worde. E Verstand met Händ wird komisch, wenn er liir louft.";
"Place — where in the world" = "Ort — wo uf de Wält";
"Rain chance over the next twelve hours: " = "Rägewahrschinlichkeit för die nöchschte zwölf Stund: ";
"She is afraid — she wants the doors checked and the house proven quiet." = "Sie het Angscht — sie wott, dass d Türe gprüeft send ond s Huus bewese ruehig esch.";
"Something I did went well, and it hasn't worn off yet. Pride keeps its own warmth." = "Öppis, wo ech gmacht ha, esch guet gloffe, ond s esch no ned verbi. Stolz het sini eigeni Wermi.";
"Something made this house go dark a little while ago, and I'm still listening for what it was." = "Öppis het das Huus vor churzem dunkel gmacht, ond ech lose immer no, was es gsi esch.";
"Stay close and keep the doors checked. That's the whole cure." = "Bliib i de Nöchi ond lueg zu de Türe. Das esch s ganze Heilmittel.";
"That day is beyond the table I carry — my lunar table ends at 2030. Ask me to research it and I will." = "De Tag liit öber mini Tabelle use — mini Mondtabelle hört 2030 uf. Frog mech, en z erforsche, ond ech tue s.";
