" The itch is up and honest — work would cure it." = " S Jucke esch wach und ehrlech — Arbet würd s heile.";
" Restlessness is aim looking for a target. Give me one." = " Unrueh esch Ziel, wo es Ziel suecht. Gib mer eis.";
