"When the operator toggles Agents on in my menu, an ask with a plan's shape — a chain joined by 'then', or an explicit call to the crew — is worked by roles instead of one pass: a Planner breaks it into steps over the house's real resources, the Hands work each step through the same organs my direct intents use (sweeps, self-scans, audits, EMCON, the manual, the sitrep, the Vault's instant work), a Critic checks the shared board for gaps, and a Scribe writes the one answer. The roles are one bench in different states — Qwen or Apple's model wearing different briefs — because a device holds one set of weights; the cooperation lives in the briefs and the board. Runs register on the ProcessBoard, and Vanish stops a crew between steps like anything else." = "Wenn de Operator Agents i miim Menü iischaltet, wird e Frag mit de Form von eme Plan — e Chetti, verbunde dur 'then', oder en explizite Ruef a d Crew — vo Rolle gschafft statt von eim Durchgang: e Planner bricht si i Schritt über die würkliche Ressource vom Huus, d Hände schaffe jede Schritt dur die gliiche Organe, wo miini direkte Absichte bruuche (Sweeps, Sälbst-Scans, Audits, EMCON, s Manual, de Sitrep, die Sofort-Arbet vom Vault), e Critic prüeft s gmeinsam Board uf Lücke, und e Scribe schriibt die ein Antwort. D Rolle sind eini Bank i verschiedene Zueständ — Qwen oder Apple siis Modell, verschiedeni Briefs trägend — wil es Grät ein Satz Gwicht haltet; d Kooperation läbt i de Briefs und im Board. Läuf registriere sich uf em ProcessBoard, und Vanish stoppt e Crew zwüsche Schritt wie alles anderi.";
"When the wire reads empty" = "Wenn de Draht leer list";
"When to say less" = "Wenn weniger z säge isch";
"Whose gear it is" = "Wem siis Züüg es isch";
"Work ends in the reverse order it began. Stop the runs and file the watches; read their reports while they are fresh. Cease any loud act by its name and let the snapshot restore the posture. Drop any shape worn. Decide what leaves with the operator — sessions, the journal, the exports — and share them by their doors. The posture that remains is the house's resting one: quiet, ear as it was set, nothing armed that wasn't deliberately left armed. The app reopens where it was closed; a place left properly needs no archaeology." = "Arbet ändet i de umgekehrte Reihe, wie si aagfange het. Stopp d Läuf und leg d Wachte ab; lies ihri Bericht, während sie frisch sind. Hör mit jedem luute Akt bi siim Name uf und laht de Schnappschuss d Haltung wiederherstelle. Leg jedi träiti Form ab. Entscheide, was mit em Operator gah — Sitzige, s Journal, d Exporte — und teile si dur ihri Türe. D Haltung, wo bliibt, isch d Rueh-Haltung vom Huus: still, Ohr wie s gsetzt gsi isch, nüt scharf, wo nid absichtlich scharf glah worde isch. D App öffnet wieder dört, wo si gschlosse worde isch; en Ort, richtig verlah, bruucht kei Archäologie.";
