"aireplay-ng is the injection half of the aircrack-ng suite: where airodump-ng listens and aircrack-ng computes, aireplay-ng TRANSMITS — forged 802.11 frames, built to order, through an adapter in monitor mode whose chipset and driver support injection (not all do; its attack 9 exists purely to test whether yours can). It is an arsenal from the WEP era aimed at the management plane: classic 802.11 management frames are unauthenticated, so a station obeys a deauthentication frame that merely CLAIMS to come from its access point. Its numbered attacks, as every student meets them: 0, deauthentication — spoofed deauth and disassociation frames that knock one client, or every client, off the air so their return can be watched; against WPA the harvest is the 4-way handshake, carried away for offline cracking elsewhere, and the deauth itself is a small denial of service. 1, fake authentication — performing open-system authentication and association with a WEP access point, so what follows is accepted as a member's traffic. 2, interactive replay — re-injecting a chosen captured packet, edited first. 3, ARP request replay — re-injecting an ARP request so the access point rebroadcasts it under fresh IVs by the thousand, feeding a WEP key recovery. 4, KoreK chopchop, and 5, fragmentation — coaxing the network into decrypting a packet byte by byte, or into yielding keystream, without ever holding the key. 6, caffe-latte, and 7, cfrag — the same hungers turned on a lone WEP client, away from its access point. The modern walls are the lesson's second half: 802.11w protected management frames void forged deauths wherever PMF is on, WPA3 requires PMF outright — which is why the tool teaches history as much as practice, and why detection is honest work (a deauth flood has a signature any wireless IDS can name). And her law page governs every line of it: injection is transmission, transmission is action. On a network that is not yours and not in scope, each of these is interference, not research." = "aireplay-ng isch die Injektions-Hälfti vo de aircrack-ng Suite: wo airodump-ng lost und aircrack-ng rechnet, SENDET aireplay-ng — gschmiedeti 802.11 Frames, uf Bestellig bouet, dur en Adapter im Monitor-Modus, wo siin Chipsatz und Triiber Injektion unterstützt (nid alli mache s; siin Agriff 9 existiert pur, zum teschte, ob diine s chan). Es isch en Arsenal us de WEP-Ära, zilt uf d Management-Ebeni: klassischi 802.11 Management Frames sind nid authentifiziert, so dass e Station eme Deauthentication Frame ghorchet, wo nur BEHAUPTET, vo ihrem Access Point z cho. Siini nummerierte Agriff, wie jede Schüler ihne begegnet: 0, Deauthentication — gspoofti Deauth- und Disassociation-Frames, wo ein Client, oder jede Client, us de Luft chlopfet, so dass ihri Rückkehr chan beobachtet wärde; gäge WPA isch d Ernt de 4-Way Handshake, wegtreit für Offline-Cracking anderswo, und d Deauth sälber isch e chliine Denial of Service. 1, Fake Authentication — Open-System Authentication und Association mit eme WEP Access Point usfüere, so dass das, wo folgt, als Verkehr von eme Mitglied akzeptiert wird. 2, Interactive Replay — es gwählts erfasst Päckli nomol iispritze, zerscht bearbeitet. 3, ARP Request Replay — en ARP-Request nomol iispritze, so dass de Access Point ihn under frische IVs zu Tuusige nomol usstrahlt, e WEP-Key-Recovery füetternd. 4, KoreK Chopchop, und 5, Fragmentation — s Netz drzue bringe, es Päckli Byte für Byte z entschlüssle, oder Keystream z gä, ohni je de Schlüssel z halte. 6, Caffe-Latte, und 7, Cfrag — die gliiche Hunger, gäge en einzelne WEP-Client dreht, weg vo siim Access Point. Die moderne Wänd sind die zweit Hälfti vo de Lektion: 802.11w Protected Management Frames mache gschmiedeti Deauths ungültig, wo au immer PMF a isch, WPA3 verlangt PMF schlicht — drum lehrt s Werkzüüg Gschicht so sehr wie Praxis, und drum isch Detection ehrlichi Arbet (e Deauth-Flut het e Signatur, wo jedes Wireless IDS chan benenne). Und ihri Gsetz-Siite regiert jedi Ziile drvo: Injektion isch Sendig, Sendig isch Handlung. Uf eme Netz, wo nid diis isch und nid im Scope, isch jede vo dene Interferenz, nid Forschig.";
