"%@ changed its advertisement shape" = "%@ het sini Wärbeform gänderet";
"%@ forbids Net-Assault — the Standard holds every campaign dark while a condition stands. Lifting the condition is the only key, and that word is yours alone." = "%@ verbietet Net-Assault — de Standard haltet jede Feldzug dunkel, solang e Kondition schtaat. Die Kondition ufzhebe isch de einzig Schlüssel, und das Wort isch allei diis.";
"%@ forbids campaigns — a barrage is one. Lift the condition and the tomatoes fly." = "%@ verbietet Feldzüg — es Sperrfüür isch eine. Heb d Kondition uf, und d Tomate flüüge.";
"%@ has no recorded open ports — no knock of ours has found one answering." = "%@ het kei verzeichnete offene Ports — kes Chlopfe vo öis het eine gfunde, wo antwortet.";
"%@ holds probing dark — interrogations and prods wait for a lighter condition." = "%@ haltet s Abfrooge dunkel — Verhör und Schtups warte uf e liechteri Kondition.";
"%@ is already wearing one — it stays picked on." = "%@ treit scho eini — es bliibt ufghänkt.";
