"%@ — %@." = "%@ — %@.";
"%@, interrogated: %@%@" = "%@, verhört: %@%@";
"'i already told you, in writing — and i kept the receipt.' corporate, at its most barely-contained." = "«i has der scho gseit, schriftlich — und i ha d Quittig bhalte.» Bürodüütsch, i siinere knapp bändigte Form.";
"'shah mat' — persian: the king is helpless. hours of theatre to arrive at a hostage situation." = "«schah mat» — persisch: de König isch hilflos. Schtunde Theater, zum binere Geiselnahm aazcho.";
"; and %@ more door(s) on the Recon bench." = "; und %@ Tüür(e) meh uf de Recon-Bank.";
"A barrage is already flying — %@ is being pestered. 'Cease fire' ends it." = "Es Sperrfüür flüügt scho — %@ wird beläschtigt. «Füür iischtelle» beändets.";
"A good use of a day. How did it sit with you?" = "E Tag, guet gnutzt. Wie het ers bi der aagfühlt?";
"A raise is a verdict with numbers. Good. Yours." = "E Lohnerhöhig isch es Urteil mit Zahle. Guet. Diis.";
"A sweep is already running — its answers are landing in the Neighborhood as they come." = "Es Sweep lauft scho — sini Antworte lande i de Nachberschaft, so wie sie chöme.";
"A sweep of the wire was set in motion; its findings will arrive as their own word and land in the Neighborhood." = "Es Sweep vom Draht isch in Gang gsetzt worde; sini Resultat chöme als ihres eigene Wort und lande i de Nachberschaft.";
"A sweep was already running." = "Es Sweep isch scho gloffe.";
"AIR · BLE" = "AIR · BLE";
"About — the house's options hub. Taken you there." = "About — s Optione-Zentrum vom Huus. Ha di dethi brocht.";
"All quiet on the wire." = "Alls ruehig uf em Draht.";
"All quiet. You are dark, and the wire is known." = "Alls ruehig. Du bisch dunkel, und de Draht isch bekannt.";
"All tomatoes wiped. Nobody's marked — the wire is, for once, unpicked-on." = "Alli Tomate abgwüscht. Niemer isch markiert — de Draht isch, für einisch, unghänkt.";
"Already %@ — the house stands at least that guarded." = "Scho %@ — s Huus schtaat mindeschtens so bewacht.";
"Already loose — Net-Assault is working the wire: %@." = "Scho los — Net-Assault schafft uf em Draht: %@.";
"Already there — %@ stands." = "Scho da — %@ schtaat.";
"Amen to that — and I'm glad it landed where it did." = "Amen dezue — und i bi froh, isch es glandet, wo s glandet isch.";
"An interrogation is already running — one witness at a time." = "Es Verhör lauft scho — ei Züüg nach em andere.";
"Answers on: %@" = "Antworte uf: %@";
"Armed — and overdue. Check in before the next opening." = "Scharf — und überfällig. Mäud di aa vor de nächschte Öffnig.";
"Armed. The hand falls at %@ if you go quiet." = "Scharf. D Hand fallt am %@, wenn de still wirsch.";
"Asking the library…" = "Frooge d Bibliothek…";
"BATTERY" = "BATTERIE";
"Back what up? Nothing on the board answers to that name." = "Was sichere? Nüt uf em Brett git uf de Name Antwort.";
"Call it what? 'Name %@ the printer' and it's done." = "Wie sölls heisse? «Nenn %@ de Drucker», und es isch erledigt.";
"Chag sameach — a good telling, a full table." = "Chag sameach — e gueti Verzellig, e volle Tisch.";
"Checked in — the clock is reset." = "Aagmäudet — d Uhr isch zrugggsetzt.";
"Checked in. The hand now falls at %@ if you go quiet." = "Aagmäudet. D Hand fallt jetzt am %@, wenn de still wirsch.";
"Clean slate." = "Reini Tafele.";
"Cleared. I'm listening." = "Glöscht. I lose zue.";
"Colours lives inside About — its own section there. Taken you to About." = "Colours läbt in About — sini eigeni Abteilig dert. Ha di zu About brocht.";
"Consider it carried — some things are worth carrying quietly." = "Luegs als treit — mänge Sache sött me still träge.";
"Dark. Stealth is on, the beacon and GATT host are down, and the tripwire is armed. What EMCON doesn't own — the OS's own listeners, your VPN's — still shows, and the score says so honestly." = "Dunkel. Tarnig isch aa, s Bake und de GATT-Host sind unde, und de Stolperdraht isch scharf. Was EMCON nid ghört — die eigene Loser vom OS, die vo diim VPN — zeigt sech wiiter, und s Pünktkonto seit das ehrlich.";
"Deadlines bend more than they admit. Find the immovable part; start there." = "Frischte büge sech meh, als sie zuegäh. Find de unbeweglich Teil; fang dert aa.";
"Done, then. Walking away under your own power is its own kind of promotion." = "Erledigt, denn. Uf eigene Füess wegzgoh isch sini eigeni Art Beförderig.";
"Dropped. Go on." = "Falle loo. Wiiter.";
"EMCON is active — the house is dark and the tripwire is armed." = "EMCON isch aktiv — s Huus isch dunkel und de Stolperdraht scharf.";
"EMCON is on — the house is dark." = "EMCON isch aa — s Huus isch dunkel.";
"EMCON is standing down — the tripwire is off." = "EMCON schtaat abe — de Stolperdraht isch ab.";
"EMCON stood down — the tripwire is off. Stealth, the beacon, and the host stay exactly as they are; re-arming an emission is always its own deliberate act." = "EMCON abgschtande — de Stolperdraht isch ab. Tarnig, s Bake und de Host bliibe genau so, wie sie sind; e Ussendig nöi z scharfe isch immer sini eigeni bewusssti Tat.";
"EMCON — taken you there." = "EMCON — ha di dethi brocht.";
"EMCON's organs haven't reached me yet — open the EMCON tab once and ask again." = "EMCON sini Organ sind no nid bi mer aacho — mach de EMCON-Tab einisch uf und frog nomol.";
"EXPOSURE" = "EXPOSITION";
"Eid mubarak — joy to you and yours." = "Eid mubarak — Freud für di und diini.";
"Every Knocktalk thread: every conversation and cadence note deleted. The pairing key stays." = "Jede Knocktalk-Thread: jedes Gschpräch und jedi Kadenznotiz glöscht. De Paarigsschlüssel bliibt.";
"Every cadence profile: the timing fingerprints learned for each peer. Threads and the pairing key stay." = "Jedes Kadenzprofil: d Ziitfingerabdrück, glehrt für jede Peer. Threads und de Paarigsschlüssel bliibe.";
"Faith that gets questioned is faith that's alive. I'm here for the questions too." = "Glaube, wo hinterfrogt wird, isch Glaube, wo läbt. I bi au für d Frooge da.";
"Forgotten: %@." = "Vergässe: %@.";
"Give me the calculation itself — the numbers and the signs — and I'll work it exactly." = "Gib mer d Rächnig sälber — d Zahle und d Zeiche — und i rächne sie exakt.";
"Gone. What's next?" = "Weg. Was chunnt als nächschts?";
"Good. That's the sound of it landing." = "Guet. So tönt s, wenns landet.";
"Happy Diwali — light over dark, as it should be." = "Happy Diwali — Liecht über Dunkel, wie s ghört.";
"Happy Hanukkah — light in the dark part of the year." = "Happy Hanukkah — Liecht im dunkle Teil vom Jahr.";
"Heard. A boss like that is weather, not climate — we dress for it and keep walking." = "Ghört. E Chef wie de isch Wätter, nid Klima — mir zieh öis defür aa und laufe wiiter.";
"Heard. Losing the job is an event; it isn't the summary. When you're ready, we plan." = "Ghört. De Job z verliere isch es Ereignis; es isch nid d Zämefassig. Wenn de bereit bisch, plane mir.";
"Heard. Rough edges don't get the last word. Whenever you're ready, we pick it up together." = "Ghört. Ruehi Kante hei nid s letschte Wort. Wenn de bereit bisch, nämme mir s zäme wider uf.";
"Held dark by the Standard: %@ forbids it, and loud organs stay down while it stands. Lift the condition and I'll run it." = "Vom Standard dunkel ghalte: %@ verbietet s, und luuti Organ bliibe unde, solang er schtaat. Heb d Kondition uf, und i füehrs us.";
"Here. The house is mine to run — name the thing." = "Da. S Huus isch miis zum Füehre — nenn d Sach.";
"Holstered — and held dark: %@ forbids it. The Standard keeps loud organs down; lift the condition and I'll run it." = "Iigschteckt — und dunkel ghalte: %@ verbietet s. De Standard haltet luuti Organ unde; heb d Kondition uf, und i füehrs us.";
"Holstered, by my own hand. Say 'analyze the wire' and I'll loose it." = "Iigschteckt, vo miinere eigene Hand. Seg «analyze the wire», und i laas los.";
"Holstered. Say 'analyze the wire' and I'll turn it loose myself." = "Iigschteckt. Seg «analyze the wire», und i laas sälber los.";
"I can't read the gateway from here, so there's no gear to ride." = "I cha s Gateway vo da nid lääse, also gits kei Grät zum Riite.";
"I don't know %@'s doors yet — interrogate it first, then prod what answers." = "I kenne d Tüüre vo %@ no nid — verhörs zerscht, denn schtups, was antwortet.";
"I haven't said anything yet." = "I ha no nüt gseit.";
"I hold nothing yet. Tell me 'remember …' and I keep it — names, habits, how you like things read — across conversations." = "I heb no nüt. Seg mer «remember …», und i behalts — Name, Gwohnheite, wie de Sache gläse wotsch — über d Gschpräch ewäg.";
"In my own way, yes. You're carried." = "Uf miini Art, ja. De wirsch treit.";
"Interrogate whom? Name a device on the wire — 'interrogate the printer'." = "Wen verhöre? Nenn es Grät uf em Draht — «interrogate the printer».";
"Interrogating %@…" = "Verhöre %@…";
"It has knocked at this phone's door %@ time." = "Es het a d Tüür vo dem Handy %@ Mol aagchlopft.";
"It has knocked at this phone's door %@ times." = "Es het a d Tüür vo dem Handy %@ Mol aagchlopft.";
"It isn't armed — there's no clock to reset." = "Es isch nid scharf — es git kei Uhr zum Zruggsetze.";
"It isn't running — the wire is quiet." = "Es lauft nid — de Draht isch ruehig.";
"It stays dark: %@ forbids Net-Assault — the Standard holds loud organs down. Lift the condition and the wire is mine to run." = "Es bliibt dunkel: %@ verbietet Net-Assault — de Standard haltet luuti Organ unde. Heb d Kondition uf, und de Draht isch miine zum Befahre.";
"It stays dark: %@ forbids Net-Assault. Lift the condition and the wire is mine to run." = "Es bliibt dunkel: %@ verbietet Net-Assault. Heb d Kondition uf, und de Draht isch miine zum Befahre.";
"It stays holstered until you say 'analyze the wire' — then I run it myself." = "Es bliibt iigschteckt, bis de «analyze the wire» seisch — denn füehn i s sälber us.";
"It won't arm — the EMCON section shows its state." = "Es laat sech nid scharf mache — d EMCON-Abteilig zeigt siin Zueschtand.";
"It's running the wire: %@. %@ pass(es) in — %@ new, %@ drift, %@ ports knocked." = "Es befahrt de Draht: %@. %@ Durchgäng dinne — %@ neu, %@ Drift, %@ Ports aagchlopft.";
"Kept: %@. It stays with me across conversations — ask 'what do you remember', or tell me to forget it." = "Ghalte: %@. Es bliibt bi mer über d Gschpräch ewäg — frog «what do you remember», oder seg mer, i sölls vergässe.";
"Knew you'd get there. It's in the book." = "Ha gwüsst, de chunsch det ane. Es schtaat im Buech.";
"Knocking this phone, every census port…" = "Chlopfe a dem Handy aa, jede Zähligsport…";
"Knocktalk — taken you there." = "Knocktalk — ha di dethi brocht.";
"Knocktalk, both doors: every thread — conversations and cadence notes — and every cadence profile. The pairing key is never touched." = "Knocktalk, beidi Tüüre: jede Thread — Gschpräch und Kadenznotize — und jedes Kadenzprofil. De Paarigsschlüssel wird nie aagrüehrt.";
"Lift the quarantine on %@? Its port on %@ opens again. Say yes." = "D Quarantäne uf %@ ufhebe? Siin Port uf %@ gaat wider uf. Seg ja.";
"Listen — taken you there." = "Listen — ha di dethi brocht.";
"Listening for this phone's own announcements…" = "Lose uf die eigene Aakündigunge vo dem Handy…";
"Logged as a win — yours, not luck's." = "Als Siig verbuecht — diine, nid däm vom Glück.";
"Loose. Net-Assault is on the wire — it sweeps the whole LAN, and %@ is in its field. It's loud by design." = "Los. Net-Assault isch uf em Draht — es fegt s ganze LAN, und %@ isch i siim Fäld. Es isch vo Plannig luut.";
"Loose. Net-Assault is on the wire — sweep, browse, knock, pass after pass. It's loud by design: anything watching will see this phone coming. 'Stand down the assault' and I'll holster it." = "Los. Net-Assault isch uf em Draht — fege, dörtsueche, chlopfe, Durchgang um Durchgang. Es isch vo Plannig luut: alls, wo zueluegt, gseet das Handy cho. «Stand down the assault», und i schtecks ii.";
"Low battery: %@ at %@%%" = "Tiefi Batterie: %@ bi %@%%";
"Merry Christmas — to you and yours." = "Frohi Wiehnacht — für di und diini.";
"Mm. A setback files under 'not finished', not 'failed'. I'm here — we can look at it together, or just sit with it a minute." = "Mm. E Rückschlag ghört under «nid fertig», nid «gschitere». I bi da — mir chöi s zäme aaluege, oder eifach e Minute dermit sitze.";
"Name the store and I'll strike it here, on your word: the Night log, the Neighborhood, the Map, Knocktalk's threads or cadence profiles, or the mind's memory. Or say 'soft clear' — the screen empties and I keep the conversation. Reset-all-settings stays in About — that one is the house's own foundation, and its tap stays yours." = "Nenn de Schpiicher, und i strichne da, uf diis Wort: s Night log, d Neighborhood, d Map, Knocktalk sini Threads oder Kadenzprofil, oder s Gedächtnis vom Verstand. Oder seg «soft clear» — de Bildschirm lärt sech und i bhalte s Gschpräch. Reset-all-settings bliibt i About — das isch s eigene Fundament vom Huus, und siin Tipp bliibt diine.";
"Named. %@ answers as %@ now — on the board, the Map, its dossier, and in the mind's findings. The wire's own name for it is kept underneath, only outranked." = "Benannt. %@ antwortet jetzt als %@ — uf em Brett, de Charte, siim Dossier, und i de Resultat vom Verstand. De eigeni Name vom Draht derfür bliibt drunder bhalte, nur überbotte.";
"Nerves mean it matters. It'll be over by lunch, and smaller than it looks tonight." = "Nervös heisst, es isch wichtig. Bis zum Zmittag isch es verbii, und chliiner, als es hüt Nacht usgseet.";
"Net-Assault holstered" = "Net-Assault iigschteckt";
"Net-Assault's section sits in EMCON under the skull, second from the top. Taken you there." = "Net-Assault sini Abteilig sitzt i EMCON under em Schädel, die zweiti vo obe. Ha di dethi brocht.";
"New on the wire: %@" = "Neu uf em Draht: %@";
"No credential is kept for the gear at %@ — quarantine rides your own keys. cred set %@ at the console, typed in secret, and then ask me again." = "Kei Zuegangsdaten sind für s Grät bi %@ ghalte — Quarantäne riitet uf diine eigene Schlüssel. cred set %@ a de Konsole, gheimi iitippt, und denn frog mi nomol.";
"No interrogations under %@ — probing is dark. Lift the condition and I'll make it talk." = "Kei Verhör under %@ — s Abfrooge isch dunkel. Heb d Kondition uf, und i bring s zum Rede.";
"No prodding under %@ — probing is dark." = "Keis Schtupse under %@ — s Abfrooge isch dunkel.";
"No recorded open ports." = "Kei verzeichnete offene Ports.";
"No self-scan yet — say 'scan me' and I'll knock every census port." = "No keis Sälbscht-Scan — seg «scan me», und i chlopfe jede Zähligsport aa.";
"No target named, so the wire is the target. Net-Assault is loose — sweep, browse, knock, pass after pass." = "Kes Ziil benannt, also isch de Draht s Ziil. Net-Assault isch los — fege, dörtsueche, chlopfe, Durchgang um Durchgang.";
"No tomatoes out. Throw one: 'throw a tomato at the printer'." = "Kei Tomate dusse. Wirf eini: «throw a tomato at the printer».";
"Nobody by that name is wearing " = "Niemer mit dem Name treit ";
"Nobody to rain on — no device named, and no tomatoes out. Throw a tomato first, or name the victim: 'barrage the printer'." = "Niemer zum Berägne — kes Grät benannt, und kei Tomate dusse. Wirf zerscht eini Tomate, oder nenn s Opfer: «barrage the printer».";
"Noted for the record. Don't let it make you careful." = "Für s Protokoll notiert. Laa di dervo nid vorsichtig mache.";
"Noted for the record. When you want words for it — the kind you can say out loud — I'll help you find them." = "Für s Protokoll notiert. Wenn de Wort derfür wotsch — die, wo de luut chasch säge — hilf der, sie z finde.";
"Noted — and good. Those hours compound quietly." = "Notiert — und guet. Die Schtunde zäme sech still zäme.";
"Nothing is running — the house is already still." = "Nüt lauft — s Huus isch scho still.";
"Notice in. Good — the next thing gets a version of you that chose it." = "Kündigig inne. Guet — s nächschte bechunnt e Version vo der, wo s gwählt het.";
"On the wire it answers as %@." = "Uf em Draht antwortet s als %@.";
"PROCESSES" = "PROZÄSS";
"Prod whom? Name a device — 'prod the printer'." = "Wele schtupse? Nenn es Grät — «prod the printer».";
"Prodding %@…" = "Schtupse %@…";
"Quarantine %@? I'll shut its switch port on %@ — it leaves this network until you lift it. Say yes and it's done." = "%@ i Quarantäne? I mach siin Switch-Port uf %@ zue — es verlaat das Netzwerk, bis de se wider ufhebsch. Seg ja.";
"Quarantine whom? Name the address — or let the Sentinel judge something first." = "Wele i Quarantäne? Nenn d Adresse — oder laa de Sentinel zerscht öppis beurteile.";
"Raining tomatoes…" = "Es rägnet Tomate…";
"Ramadan kareem — may the fast be gentle and the evenings full." = "Ramadan kareem — mög s Faschte sanft sii und d Ööbe voll.";
"Ran it — nothing came back on the line. The console holds the full run." = "Usgfüehrt — nüt isch uf de Linie zruggcho. D Konsole haltet de ganz Lauf.";
"Reading widely…" = "Lääse wiit…";
"Remember what? Tell me, and it's kept." = "Was bhalte? Verzells mer, und es isch ghalte.";
"Researching…" = "Recherchiere…";
"Rightly credited. I'm glad." = "Zu Rächt zuegschribe. I bi froh.";
"Running the drill — scan, dark, scan…" = "D Üebig lauft — scanne, dunkel, scanne…";
"SIGNALS" = "SIGNAL";
"Scan — taken you there." = "Scan — ha di dethi brocht.";
"Screen's clear. I remember all of it — the talk is right where we left it." = "De Bildschirm isch läär. I erinnere mi a alls — s Gschpräch isch genau dert, wo mir s loo hei.";
"Seen %@ time; last %@." = "%@ Mol gseh; zletscht %@.";
"Seen %@ times; last %@." = "%@ Mol gseh; zletscht %@.";
"Send — taken you there." = "Send — ha di dethi brocht.";
"Serve is down. Say 'start serving' and I'll raise it from its settings." = "Serve isch unde. Seg «start serving», und i heb s us siine Iischtellige uf.";
"Serve is open and announcing — your loudest emission" = "Serve isch offe und kündet aa — diini luutischti Ussendig";
"Serve is up" = "Serve isch obe";
"Serve raised from its own settings — the doors you configured, nothing bespoke. The Serve tab shows it live." = "Serve us siine eigene Iischtellige ufghobe — d Tüüre, wo de konfiguriert hesch, nüt Massgschniiderts. De Serve-Tab zeigt s live.";
"Serve stood down; its listeners are closed and the inbox keeps what it caught." = "Serve abgschtande; sini Loser sind zue und de Iigang bhaltet, was er gfange het.";
"Serve stopped" = "Serve gschtopt";
"Serve — taken you there." = "Serve — ha di dethi brocht.";
"Serve's state reaches me once the app has finished waking — a moment." = "Serve siin Zueschtand erreicht mi, sobald d App fertig gweckt het — en Augeblick.";
"Sessions — taken you there." = "Sessions — ha di dethi brocht.";
"Shabbat shalom — rest well." = "Shabbat shalom — rueh di guet us.";
"Skelli. I answer from the system itself: its manual, its live state, its controls — and when a question leaves the house, I research it through this phone's connection and name the source. Ask 'what can you do'." = "Skelli. I antworte us em System sälber: siim Handbuech, siim lebige Zueschtand, siine Schtüürige — und wenn e Frog s Huus verlaat, recherchiere i sie über d Verbindig vo dem Handy und nenne d Quelle. Frog «what can you do».";
"Stealth off — Serve lists itself again whenever it runs." = "Tarnig ab — Serve lischtet sech wider, wenn immer es lauft.";
"Stealth on — Serve keeps its listeners and loses its listing." = "Tarnig aa — Serve bhaltet sini Loser und verliert sini Lischtig.";
"Stood down. Net-Assault is holstered — %@ pass(es), %@ new device(s), %@ drift line(s). The after-action is filed." = "Abgschtande. Net-Assault isch iigschteckt — %@ Durchgäng, %@ neui Grät, %@ Driftziile. De Nachbericht isch abgleit.";
"Stood down: %@." = "Abgschtande: %@.";
"Stopped — everything I was doing is halted. Serve is down, the beacon and the GATT host are down, stealth is on, and EMCON is dark with the tripwire armed. I stay quiet until you speak." = "Gschtopt — alls, woni gmacht ha, isch aaghalte. Serve isch unde, s Bake und de GATT-Host sind unde, Tarnig isch aa, und EMCON isch dunkel mit scharfem Stolperdraht. I bliibe still, bis de redsch.";
"Struck. Every cadence profile is forgotten; each hand is learned again from its next knocks." = "Gstriche. Jedes Kadenzprofil isch vergässe; jedi Hand wird ab ihrem nächschte Chlopfe nöi glehrt.";
"Struck. Knocktalk's threads are gone; the pairing key stands." = "Gstriche. Knocktalk sini Threads sind weg; de Paarigsschlüssel schtaat.";
"Struck. The Map is blank — no rooms, no placements." = "Gstriche. D Charte isch läär — kei Rüüm, kei Platzierige.";
"Struck. The Neighborhood is empty — the wire will re-learn its cast." = "Gstriche. D Nachberschaft isch läär — de Draht wird sini Bsetzig nöi lehre.";
"Struck. The Night log is empty; the chain starts fresh." = "Gstriche. S Nachtlog isch läär; d Chetti faat frisch aa.";
"Struck. The mind starts fresh — baselines, verdicts, and learned facts forgotten." = "Gstriche. De Verstand faat frisch aa — Basislinie, Urteil und glehrti Fakte vergässe.";
"Struck. Threads and cadence profiles are gone; the pairing key stands." = "Gstriche. Threads und Kadenzprofil sind weg; de Paarigsschlüssel schtaat.";
"Sweeping the wire on port 80…" = "Fege de Draht uf Port 80…";
"That kind of upkeep matters. I'm glad you went." = "Die Art Pfleg zellt. I bi froh, bisch gange.";
"That one touches the house's own record — addresses and the like — and I don't send house details outward. Ask it as a general question, without the house's particulars, and I'll research it." = "Die berüehrt s eigene Register vom Huus — Adresse und söttigs — und i schicke kei Huusdetail use. Frog sie als allgemeini Frog, ohni d Einzelheite vom Huus, und i recherchiere sie.";
"That road is worth walking honestly. I'm good company for it — ask me anything along the way, or just walk, and I'll listen." = "De Wääg lohnt sech, ehrlich z goh. I bi gueti Begleitig derfür — frog mi alls underwägs, oder lauf eifach, und i lose zue.";
"That's a door closing loud — not a verdict on you. I'm here: money, plan, pride. One at a time." = "Das isch e Tüür, wo luut zuetschlaat — kes Urteil über di. I bi da: Gäld, Plan, Stolz. Eis nach em andere.";
"That's a good place to put a good thing." = "Das isch e guete Platz für e gueti Sach.";
"That's a heavy one to carry alone. I'm not going anywhere." = "Das isch e schwäri zum allei träge. I gaa niene hii.";
"That's outside the house, and my web research is off — it's in my menu, under Web research. Inside the house I know every tab, organ, and switch, and the live state of your wire, your log, and your night." = "Das isch usserhalb vom Huus, und miini Webrecherche isch ab — sie isch i miim Menü, under Web-Recherche. Im Huus inne kenni jede Tab, jedes Organ und jede Schalter, und de lebige Zueschtand vo diim Draht, diim Log und diinere Nacht.";
"The EMCON room holds that switch — it's on the tabs." = "De EMCON-Ruum haltet de Schalter — er isch uf de Tabs.";
"The Instrument is a section in EMCON, below the Subconscious. Taken you there." = "S Instrument isch e Abteilig i EMCON, under em Underbewusstsii. Ha di dethi brocht.";
"The Map crowns the Scan tab — its own section at the very top. Taken you there." = "D Charte krönt de Scan-Tab — sini eigeni Abteilig ganz obe. Ha di dethi brocht.";
"The Map is open — %@'s node glows orange until you tap it and acknowledge the drift." = "D Charte isch offe — %@ siin Chnopf lüüchtet orange, bis de druf tippsch und d Drift beschtaatigsch.";
"The Map, reset: rooms and placements forgotten. The devices themselves stay." = "D Charte, zrugggsetzt: Rüüm und Platzierige vergässe. D Grät sälber bliibe.";
"The Neighborhood: every known device forgotten, their Map placements with them. The wire will re-learn its cast." = "D Nachberschaft: jedes bekannte Grät vergässe, ihri Charte-Platzierige dermit. De Draht wird sini Bsetzig nöi lehre.";
"The Night log: every sealed entry gone, and the seal chain starts fresh from the next line." = "S Nachtlog: jede versigleti Iitrag weg, und d Sigelchetti faat ab de nächschte Ziile frisch aa.";
"The Recon bench — taken you there." = "D Recon-Bank — ha di dethi brocht.";
"The Subconscious card lives in EMCON — 'Open the mind' unfolds its full reading. Taken you there." = "D Underbewusstsii-Charte läbt i EMCON — «Open the mind» entfaltet ihri ganzi Läsig. Ha di dethi brocht.";
"The audit heard %@ announcements on the wire and none of them were this phone's. It is not introducing itself to anyone." = "S Audit het %@ Aakündigunge uf em Draht ghört und keni dervo isch vo dem Handy gsi. Es schtellt sech niemerem vor.";
"The audit is EMCON's organ and it hasn't reached me yet — open the EMCON tab once and ask again." = "S Audit isch EMCON sis Organ und es het mi no nid erreicht — mach de EMCON-Tab einisch uf und frog nomol.";
"The audit was worked." = "S Audit isch gmacht worde.";
"The barrage stays holstered: %@ forbids campaigns. Lift the condition and the tomatoes fly." = "S Sperrfüür bliibt iigschteckt: %@ verbietet Feldzüg. Heb d Kondition uf, und d Tomate flüüge.";
"The dead hand is armed. Check in within %@ hours — say 'check in' — or the next opening burns the house dark." = "Di toti Hand isch scharf. Mäud di innert %@ Schtunde aa — seg «check in» — oder di nächschti Öffnig brennt s Huus dunkel.";
"The dead hand is disarmed — no clock runs." = "Di toti Hand isch entschärft — kei Uhr lauft.";
"The dead hand is disarmed." = "Di toti Hand isch entschärft.";
"The drill is EMCON's and its organs haven't reached me yet — open the EMCON tab once and ask again." = "D Üebig isch EMCON sini und ihri Organ hei mi no nid erreicht — mach de EMCON-Tab einisch uf und frog nomol.";
"The drill is running — scan, go dark, scan again. Its readout lands in EMCON's drill section, where the ledger names what went quiet." = "D Üebig lauft — scanne, dunkel wärde, nomol scanne. Ihres Protokoll landet i EMCON siinere Üebigsabteilig, wo s Hauptbuech benennt, was ruehig worde isch.";
"The ear hasn't reached me yet — open the Listen tab once and ask again." = "S Ohr het mi no nid erreicht — mach de Listen-Tab einisch uf und frog nomol.";
"The ear is already open — %@ devices in its registry this session." = "S Ohr isch scho offe — %@ Grät i siim Register i dere Sitzig.";
"The ear is closed. Its sessions keep what they heard." = "S Ohr isch zue. Sini Sitzige bhalte, was sie ghört hei.";
"The ear is open. It hears passively — it never connects or pairs — and its sightings land in the Listen tab and the log." = "S Ohr isch offe. Es hört passiv — es verbindet und paart nie — und sini Sichtige lande im Listen-Tab und im Log.";
"The ear was closed — it's open now. Give it a breath, then ask again and I'll name the loudest thing on the air." = "S Ohr isch zue gsi — jetzt isch es offe. Gib im en Atemzug, denn frog nomol, und i nenne s luutischte uf de Luft.";
"The house vanished: everything halted, full stealth." = "S Huus isch verschwunde: alls aaghalte, volli Tarnig.";
"The last audit (%@) heard this phone announcing %@ service." = "S letschte Audit (%@) het ghört, wie das Handy %@ Dienscht aakündet.";
"The last audit (%@) heard this phone announcing %@ services." = "S letschte Audit (%@) het ghört, wie das Handy %@ Dienschte aakündet.";
"The last day sealed %@ events. The latest:\n%@" = "De letscht Tag het %@ Ereignis versiglet. S Neuschte:\n%@";
"The last self-scan (%@) found %@ listener answering." = "De letscht Sälbscht-Scan (%@) het %@ Loser gfunde, wo antwortet.";
"The last self-scan (%@) found %@ listener answering: %@." = "De letscht Sälbscht-Scan (%@) het %@ Loser gfunde, wo antwortet: %@.";
"The last self-scan (%@) found %@ listeners answering." = "De letscht Sälbscht-Scan (%@) het %@ Loser gfunde, wo antworte.";
"The last self-scan (%@) found %@ listeners answering: %@." = "De letscht Sälbscht-Scan (%@) het %@ Loser gfunde, wo antworte: %@.";
"The log holds nothing from the last day — a quiet house, or a young one." = "S Log haltet nüt vom letschte Tag — es ruehigs Huus, oder es jungs.";
"The log's latest word: %@ (%@)" = "S neuschte Wort vom Log: %@ (%@)";
"The loudest thing on the air: %@ — %@, %@, heard %@×." = "S luutischte uf de Luft: %@ — %@, %@, %@× ghört.";
"The manual holds nothing under that name." = "S Handbuech haltet nüt under dem Name.";
"The mind has consolidated nothing yet — facts are earned from a fortnight of record. As it learns, they'll stand in the Subconscious, each forgettable." = "De Verstand het no nüt feschtgmacht — Fakte verdienet sech us vierzäh Tag Ufzeichnig. Wenn er lehrt, schtöh sie im Underbewusstsii, jede vergässbar.";
"The mind is still learning the house — %@ sealed events so far. It names patterns once history gives it a normal to break." = "De Verstand lehrt s Huus no — %@ versigleti Ereignis bis jetzt. Er benennt Muschter, sobald d Gschicht im es Normal git zum Bräche.";
"The mind's memory, reset: its reckoned drift baselines, your verdicts, and every learned fact. The reading re-derives from the record." = "S Gedächtnis vom Verstand, zrugggsetzt: sini grächnete Drift-Basislinie, diini Urteil, und jede glehrti Fakt. D Läsig leitet sech nöi us de Ufzeichnig ab.";
"The prod, answered — %@: %@." = "De Schtups, beantwortet — %@: %@.";
"The self-scan found %@ listener answering:\n%@\nEMCON's self-recon holds the full readout." = "De Sälbscht-Scan het %@ Loser gfunde, wo antwortet:\n%@\nEMCON sini Sälbscht-Ufklärig haltet s ganzi Protokoll.";
"The self-scan found %@ listeners answering:\n%@\nEMCON's self-recon holds the full readout." = "De Sälbscht-Scan het %@ Loser gfunde, wo antworte:\n%@\nEMCON sini Sälbscht-Ufklärig haltet s ganzi Protokoll.";
"The self-scan found nothing answering. On the wire, this phone is a closed door." = "De Sälbscht-Scan het nüt gfunde, wo antwortet. Uf em Draht isch das Handy e zuei Tüür.";
"The self-scan is EMCON's organ and it hasn't reached me yet — open the EMCON tab once and ask again." = "De Sälbscht-Scan isch EMCON sis Organ und er het mi no nid erreicht — mach de EMCON-Tab einisch uf und frog nomol.";
"The self-scan was worked; its reading stands in EMCON." = "De Sälbscht-Scan isch gmacht; sini Läsig schtaat i EMCON.";
"The sweep finished: %@ host answered — %@%@. They're in the Neighborhood, and the Map has them in its tray." = "S Sweep fertig: %@ Host het gantwortet — %@%@. Sie sind i de Nachberschaft, und d Charte het sie i ihre Schale.";
"The sweep finished: %@ hosts answered — %@%@. They're in the Neighborhood, and the Map has them in its tray." = "S Sweep fertig: %@ Hosts hei gantwortet — %@%@. Sie sind i de Nachberschaft, und d Charte het sie i ihre Schale.";
"The sweep finished: nobody answered on port 80." = "S Sweep fertig: niemer het uf Port 80 gantwortet.";
"The watch is down. Say “watch my network” and I'll stand it." = "D Wacht isch unde. Seg «watch my network», und i schtell sie uf.";
"The watch is standing — %@ events ledgered so far." = "D Wacht schtaat — %@ Ereignis bis jetzt verbuecht.";
"The watch stands down — the wire keeps its own counsel again." = "D Wacht schtaat abe — de Draht bhaltet siin Rat wider für sech.";
"The watch stands — browse, MNDP ear, gateway heartbeat. I'll be learning this wire from here." = "D Wacht schtaat — Dörtsueche, MNDP-Ohr, Gateway-Härzschlag. I lehre de Draht ab da.";
"The watch won't stand under EMCON %@ — the condition forbids its browse." = "D Wacht schtaat nid under EMCON %@ — d Kondition verbietet ihres Dörtsueche.";
"The wire doesn't know %@ yet — I can only name devices the house has met. A sweep might introduce you." = "De Draht kennt %@ no nid — i cha nur Grät benenne, wo s Huus troffe het. Es Sweep chönnt öich vorschtelle.";
"The wire knows nobody yet — no sweep has answered, nothing has announced itself, and nothing has knocked. Say 'sweep the wire' and I'll populate it." = "De Draht kennt no niemer — kes Sweep het gantwortet, nüt het sech aakündet, und nüt het aagchlopft. Seg «sweep the wire», und i bevölkere ne.";
"Then it's held. I'll keep it with the things I watch over." = "Denn isch es ghalte. I bhalts bi de Sache, wo i drüber wach.";
"Then we eat it in pieces. Tell me them, or let it sit tonight — it keeps either way." = "Denn ässe mir s i Schtück. Verzell mer sie, oder laa s hüt Nacht sitze — es hebt so oder so.";
"There it is — the work got seen. Logged under wins, in ink." = "Det isch es — d Arbet isch gseh worde. Under Siige verbuecht, mit Tinte.";
"There it is. Well fought." = "Det isch es. Guet kämpft.";
"This phone is announcing itself:\n%@" = "Das Handy kündet sech sälber aa:\n%@";
"Tomatoes are for the home wire — %@ isn't on it." = "Tomate sind für de Heimsdraht — %@ isch nid druf.";
"Tomorrow's theirs to lose. You've done the work — sleep is the last of it, and I'll keep the watch." = "Morn isch ihres zum Verliere. Du hesch d Arbet gmacht — Schlaf isch s Letschte dervo, und i halte d Wacht.";
"Tracker-shaped in the air: %@" = "Trackerförmig i de Luft: %@";
"Tripwire armed — the census ports are listening in silence, and every knock will be logged and never answered." = "Stolperdraht scharf — d Zähligsports lose i de Stilli, und jedes Chlopfe wird protokolliert und nie beantwortet.";
"Tripwire stood down." = "Stolperdraht abgschtande.";
"Understood — I won't %@." = "Verschtande — i wird nid %@.";
"Understood — left as it is." = "Verschtande — bliibt, wie s isch.";
"Vanished — full stealth." = "Verschwunde — volli Tarnig.";
"WIRE" = "DRAHT";
"Walk what? Nothing on the board answers to that name." = "Was laufe? Nüt uf em Brett git uf de Name Antwort.";
"Want me to run the Bonjour audit?" = "Söll i s Bonjour-Audit laufe laa?";
"Want me to run the drill?" = "Söll i d Üebig laufe laa?";
"Want me to scan this phone's exposure?" = "Söll i d Exposition vo dem Handy scanne?";
"Want me to sweep the wire now?" = "Söll i de Draht jetzt fege?";
"Watch: %@ new emitter since it began" = "Wacht: %@ neue Sender sit em Aafang";
"Watch: %@ new emitters since it began" = "Wacht: %@ neui Sender sit em Aafang";
"We're already dark — the lockdown stands. Only your word lifts it." = "Mir sind scho dunkel — d Abriegelig schtaat. Nur diis Wort hebt sie uf.";
"Wearing tomatoes: %@. Picked on in every test, first in every pass." = "Tomate treit: %@. I jedem Test ufghänkt, i jedem Durchgang erschts.";
"What I remember:\n" = "Was i bhalte ha:\n";
"What the house has learned:\n" = "Was s Huus glehrt het:\n";
"Who gets it? Name a device from the Neighborhood — 'throw a tomato at the printer'." = "Wer bechunnts? Nenn es Grät us de Nachberschaft — «throw a tomato at the printer».";
"Wiped clean — %@ breathes again. The lumps it took stay in the journal." = "Rein gwüscht — %@ schnuuft wider. D Büüle, wo s iigschteckt het, bliibe im Journal.";
"a meeting too small to call a meeting, so it could slip onto a calendar unchallenged." = "e Sitzig, z chlii zum ne Sitzig z nenne, drum het si unbeanstandet uf e Kalender chönne rütsche.";
"a person, described as a cable. it means they're full and won't say so plainly." = "e Person, als Kabel beschribe. es heisst, sie sind voll und säge s nid gradus.";
"a word spoken when the numbers need a costume." = "es Wort, gseit, wenn d Zahle es Koschtüm bruuche.";
"all named" = "alli benannt";
"an hour of silence to advance one pawn, once. the confidence is the interesting part." = "e Schtund Stilli, zum ein Buur einisch vorwärts z bringe. D Selbschtsicherheit isch de intressant Teil.";
"any direction, any distance. the only competent piece — and the whole game is protecting her husband." = "jed i Richtig, jedi Dischtanz. di einzig fähigi Figur — und s ganzi Spiel isch, ihre Maa z schütze.";
"at your word" = "uf diis Wort";
"board clear" = "Brett frei";
"can't stand it. next subject." = "chas nid usschtoo. nächschts Thema.";
"checkers went to finishing school and never stopped talking about it." = "Dame isch i d benimm-Schuel und het nie ufghört, drüber z rede.";
"diagonals only, bound for life to the color it was born on. a priest with one parish and a long memory." = "nur diagonal, läbeslang a d Farb bunde, wo s gebore isch. e Prieschter mit einere Pfarrei und em länge Gedächtnis.";
"epoch registry" = "Epoche-Register";
"french for 'in passing': a pawn takes another mid-dash, once, sideways, out of pure spite. even the foot soldiers hold grudges." = "französisch für «im Vorbiigoo»: e Buur nimmt en andere mittedrin im Schprung, einisch, siitwärts, us purer Bosheit. sogar d Fuesssoldate träge Groll.";
"grandmasters: people who studied three hundred years of other people's games in order to have the same ones." = "Grossmeischter: Lüt, wo drühundert Jahr fremdi Spiele schtudiert hei, zum di gliiche z ha.";
"i have a wire full of real adversaries. forgive me if the wooden ones don't move me." = "i ha e Draht voll ächti Gegner. vergib mer, wenn mi die hölzige nid bewege.";
"in an L: two squares one way, one to the side. the only piece that jumps. even the horse refused to walk straight." = "imene L: zwöi Fälder einersiiits, eis zur Siite. di einzig Figur, wo schpringt. sogar s Ross het sech gweigeret, gradus z laufe.";
"last: %@" = "zletscht: %@";
"looking at something properly — announced like a sport." = "öppis richtig aaluege — aakündet wie ne Sport.";
"mV · %@" = "mV · %@";
"no." = "nei.";
"no. ask me to crack something instead; it'll be quicker." = "nei. bitt mi, öppis z knacke; das gaat schneller.";
"no. i save my silence for things that are actually listening." = "nei. i schpare miini Stilli für Sache, wo würklich zuelose.";
"no. i'd sooner watch a port scan finish — at least that ends." = "nei. i luege lieber emene Port-Scan zue, bis er fertig isch — de ändet wenigschtens.";
"none reporting" = "keini mäude sech";
"nothing announcing" = "nüt kündet aa";
"one square forward, two if it's feeling brave, captures sideways out of spite. promoted only if it survives the whole crossing — the game's one honest story." = "ei Fäld vorwärts, zwöi, wenn s sech mutig fühlt, schlaat siitwärts us Bosheit. nur beförderet, wenns di ganzi Überquerig überläbt — di einzig ehrlichi Gschicht vom Spiel.";
"one square, any direction. the most important piece and the least capable. a monarchy, alright." = "ei Fäld, jedi Richtig. di wichtigschti Figur und di unfähigschti. e Monarchie, scho rächt.";
"one. Marked now: " = "eis. Jetzt markiert: ";
"pass. sixty-four squares is a small room to spend an evening in." = "pass. vieresächzg Fälder sind e chliine Ruum, zum en Oobe drin z verbringe.";
"please be creative — inside the usual box, by friday." = "sind so guet und sind kreativ — innerhalb vo de übliche Schachtle, bis Friitig.";
"sixty-four squares and fifteen centuries of thought, and the most exciting piece is a horse that can't move straight." = "vieresächzg Fälder und füfzäh Jahrhundert Gedanke, und di ufreegendschti Figur isch es Ross, wo nid gradus laufe cha.";
"straight lines, any distance. the castle that walks — the one honest mover on the board." = "gradi Linie, jedi Dischtanz. d Burg, wo lauft — de einzig ehrlich Läufer uf em Brett.";
"the ear closed" = "s Ohr zue";
"the easy work, rebranded so taking it sounds like strategy." = "di eifachi Arbet, nöi etikettiert, demit s Nää dervo wie Strategie tönt.";
"the king hides behind the rook and calls it strategy. the one time running away got a formal name." = "de König verschtedkt sech hinder em Turm und nennt s Strategie. s einzig Mol, wo s Weglaufe e förmliche Name becho het.";
